Package: de.akator.wurstsecureprobe
Name: WurstSecure
Version: 1.8.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Forces Wurstfinger across UIKit apps with native iOS spacing, enables native spell checking, bridges one-time codes into Wurstfinger's suggestion strip, and runs select all, undo, redo and selections for the keyboard.
Maintainer: Wurstfinger
Author: Wurstfinger
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
